  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to IFIT&#x2019;s programme in Colombia, where it is actively engaged on peace, mediation, conflict resolution and reconciliation issues. IFIT&#x2019;s overall mission is to increase stability, peace and reconciliation in fragile and conflict-affected societies through the promotion of evidence-based policymaking, strengthening of public awareness, and increased local participation in peace-building efforts. In Colombia, IFIT supports the existing peace architecture established following the 2016 peace agreement with FARC, translating this into evidence-based solutions while promoting depolarisation.</narrative>
  </description>
